{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】康文署「SmartPLAY」康體通懷疑有資料外洩，初步約9萬人受影響。</p>\n<p>私隱專員公署接獲事故通報指，初步顯示，可能有約9萬人受影響，包括姓名、性別、出生日期、地址、電郵地址和電話號碼。公署正調查事故，提醒相關機構盡快通知受影響人士。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:23:56.725637+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:57:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T11:17:29.431146+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T11:17:29.431146+00:00","content_hash":"7cc50c84ee05775ca1d1ddda2f5e251b5e4b2e56bc96df2cbb3be99bfde96246","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}